ure Screen**:\n+The VitaDeck-painted screen that replaces the **Active Deck App** after it throws an uncaught error (during boot, render, effects, input handlers, or timers), showing the error message, the first lines of its stack, and that **Start Input** opens the **VitaDeck Shell**. A **Deck App Runtime Restart** clears it.\n+_Avoid_: Crash screen, red box, blank screen\n+\n **Runtime Upload Archive**:\n A zip file that unpacks to exactly one top-level **Deck App Package Directory** whose name ends in `.vdapp`.\n _Avoid_: Source zip, VPK, npm tarball\n","complete":true,"hunks":[{"path":"CONTEXT.md","oldStart":168,"oldLines":6,"newStart":168,"newLines":10,"header":"@@ -168,6 +168,10 @@ _Avoid_: Uninstall, rollback, package rename","language":"markdown","lines":[{"kind":"ctx","oldNumber":168,"newNumber":168,"text":"Restarting the Deck App JavaScript runtime with a fresh context after **Runtime Upload Replacement** of the **Active Deck App** or after changing the **Active Deck App**."},{"kind":"ctx","oldNumber":169,"newNumber":169,"text":"_Avoid_: Hot reload, refresh, soft reload"},{"kind":"ctx","oldNumber":170,"newNumber":170,"text":""},{"kind":"add","oldNumber":null,"newNumber":171,"text":"**Deck App Failure Screen**:"},{"kind":"add","oldNumber":null,"newNumber":172,"text":"The VitaDeck-painted screen that replaces the **Active Deck App** after it throws an uncaught error (during boot, render, effects, input handlers, or timers), showing the error message, the first lines of its stack, and that **Start Input** opens the **VitaDeck Shell**. A **Deck App Runtime Restart** clears it."},{"kind":"add","oldNumber":null,"newNumber":173,"text":"_Avoid_: Crash screen, red box, blank screen"},{"kind":"add","oldNumber":null,"newNumber":174,"text":""},{"kind":"ctx","oldNumber":171,"newNumber":175,"text":"**Runtime Upload Archive**:"},{"kind":"ctx","oldNumber":172,"newNumber":176,"text":"A zip file that unpacks to exactly one top-level **Deck App Package Directory** whose name ends in `.vdapp`."},{"kind":"ctx","oldNumber":173,"newNumber":177,"text":"_Avoid_: Source zip, VPK, npm tarball"}]}]}]}
